[{"id":"archive-2133","post_id":"2133","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02XX7zRf2v5XhSAVg4CAcocpoAaQsB1bRyGgW9Hro7f2e1RapudsD4txkNxZh8Qufml","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-30","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2133/","text":"Just shared Meta's quarterly earnings report. AI continues to transform everything we do -- Meta AI now has almost 1 billion monthly actives, we're making good progress on AI glasses, and we're...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02XX7zRf2v5XhSAVg4CAcocpoAaQsB1bRyGgW9Hro7f2e1RapudsD4txkNxZh8Qufml","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2147","post_id":"2147","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DJDhoQfxb43","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-29","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2147/","text":"Hosted our first ever LlamaCon today for AI developers. Thanks to Ali, Satya and everyone who joined us! 🦙","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DJDhoQfxb43","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2146","post_id":"2146","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DJCdo4EvIrk","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-29","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2146/","text":"Talking with @databricksinc co-founder and CEO Ali Ghodsi live from LlamaCon at 10:45am. Tune in here -- llama.com/live","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DJCdo4EvIrk","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2132","post_id":"2132","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/reel/1194067775494747/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-29","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2132/","text":"New Meta AI app out today! Almost a billion monthly actives use Meta AI across our apps so we dropped a new standalone app. Check it out!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/reel/1194067775494747/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2131","post_id":"2131","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02oH6o7nQmc2wECvzibfMiKLuPUEhKxkm32SZDFUG6uBVsek9rU4b8LvCH7MwsYvcfl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-27","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2131/","text":"Annual 5k run with Guerrilla fight crew. Finished a bit above 20 mins. Proud of the team! 💪","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02oH6o7nQmc2wECvzibfMiKLuPUEhKxkm32SZDFUG6uBVsek9rU4b8LvCH7MwsYvcfl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2145","post_id":"2145","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DI3mC0GxkYA","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-25","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2145/","text":"Llama is headed to space. It'll be used on the ISS so astronauts can operate AI locally and get things done faster. One small step for AI, and one giant leap for Llamakind!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DI3mC0GxkYA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2144","post_id":"2144","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DIja6N0prj5","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2144/","text":"Open sourcing some good research today that helps AI systems understand perception, localization, and reasoning. Two  releases I'm excited about: Meta Perception Encoder that excels in image and video tasks, serving as eyes that enable AI systems to interpret visual information and understand the world, and Meta Locate 3D that can understand and locate 3D objects in space. Glad to get these out to the community.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DIja6N0prj5","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2130","post_id":"2130","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0cj65MFmvT9KfkX1LUR7tDgxmGAyMh9mv39qQLRVgyPc8PeWsJHwVMgmEvCtLnfRal","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2130/","text":"I'm excited to share that Patrick Collison and Dina Powell McCormick are joining Meta's board of directors. Many businesses rely on our services to grow -- and Dina and Patrick will help us continue...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0cj65MFmvT9KfkX1LUR7tDgxmGAyMh9mv39qQLRVgyPc8PeWsJHwVMgmEvCtLnfRal","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2143","post_id":"2143","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DIRZINYx9Lu","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2143/","text":"Looking forward to two great fireside chats at LlamaCon: one with Microsoft CEO @satyanadella about AI development, and one with Databricks CEO Ali Ghodsi about open source AI!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DIRZINYx9Lu","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2129","post_id":"2129","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid027eLWTpzeMHuH7zzGAy3Ti9hTSvn1G3hm1DLGVKTfhyBupMTBisvm3adDieztkVzAl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-06","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2129/","text":"Priscilla and I helped start the Breakthrough Prize to honor great scientists and achievements. Always a fun night presenting their awards with Vin Diesel!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid027eLWTpzeMHuH7zzGAy3Ti9hTSvn1G3hm1DLGVKTfhyBupMTBisvm3adDieztkVzAl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2142","post_id":"2142","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DIE4fqtyVZc","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-04-05","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuck